<title>BELGIUM: TRUSTMETAL PLUNGES TO LOSS IN 1996.</title>
<headline>TRUSTMETAL PLUNGES TO LOSS IN 1996.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Belgian francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss		 117.5     vs   64.4 profit</p>
<p>    Operating profit	 9.8     vs    9.7</p>
<p>    Financial loss	   6.9     vs   10.8</p>
<p>    Exceptional loss     120.0     vs   65.4 gain</p>
<p>NOTE - Trustmetal NV, a Belgian industrial holding company, said the exceptional loss reflected depreciation on a 10 percent stake in Manoir Industries.</p>
<p>It said the share price of Manoir fell to 190 French francs at the end of 1996 from 280 French francs a year earlier, which Trustmetal said was probably due to the lack of liquidity in the share.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
